		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>40-foot-long, three-headed green dragon. No arms or legs, two tattered wings. All khala are female, how they have offspring is unknown.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 45, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +7 (2d10) or 1 ice breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ice Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage and frozen for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Iceblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
